  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "WANDERING\n\n[my thing, forward, turn,\n a die of 3, a -2, a x30]\n\nEach round, on the turn:\n  the die lands on it: 1..3\n  the -2 lands on it: -1..1\n  the x30 lands on it\n  a copy goes to the bird\nthen a copy of forward goes\nto the bird.\n\nyaw and forward are the\nturtle's own words."
   },
   "x": -1.45,
   "z": 2.15
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nSet Speed to Instant and\ngive the work box to the\nWanderer.\n\nThe star drifts about the\ntable, nowhere in\nparticular.\n\nHold the die and type 5:\nit turns right more often\nthan left, and circles. Why?"
   },
   "x": -0.75,
   "z": 2.15
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "IN THE YARD\n\nSet the zoo out, carry this\npad through the back door,\ndrop it on an animal and\npress SPACE on the pad.\n\nThe animal wanders. Copy the\npad on Mimi for the next one.\n\nNothing here is about\nanimals: a die re-rolls a\nnumber, and a bird carries\na message."
   },
